  <section class="bht-faq">
    <div class="bht-faq__img"><img src="{{ 'bh-trade-desk-1600.jpg' | asset_url }}" srcset="{{ 'bh-trade-desk-800.jpg' | asset_url }} 800w, {{ 'bh-trade-desk-1600.jpg' | asset_url }} 1600w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 42vw, 100vw" width="1600" height="1381" loading="lazy" alt="A Bramley House study with a turned-leg writing desk and a navy wingback armchair beside a bookcase"></div>
    <div class="bht-faq__body">
      <p class="bht__eb">Questions</p>
      <h2 class="bht__h">Trade terms &amp; FAQs</h2>
      <div class="bh-trade">

<details><summary>What are the trade terms?</summary><ol style="margin:12px 0 0;padding-left:20px;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;line-height:1.55">
<li>Trade pricing is for approved members buying on behalf of clients or a business.</li>
<li>Each trade code belongs to the approved member and may not be shared, posted or resold.</li>
<li>Trade pricing applies to orders placed after approval and cannot be added to past orders.</li>
<li>Trade pricing cannot be combined with other discount codes or promotions.</li>
<li>All trade orders follow the Bramley House Shipping &amp; Returns policy.</li>
<li>We may update trade pricing, benefits or these terms. We will email members before a change takes effect, and orders already placed keep the terms they were placed under.</li>
<li>We may decline an application, or end a membership if a code is shared or misused.</li>
</ol></details>
<details><summary>Does my trade pricing increase over time?</summary><p>Yes. Trade pricing starts at 15% and increases as your annual volume with us grows. We review member volume and let you know when your pricing changes.</p></details>
<details><summary>Do you offer pricing for large or multi-unit projects?</summary><p>Yes. For property managers, hospitality groups and other multi-unit projects, we offer custom project discounts beyond standard trade pricing, considered case by case. Email us at <a href="mailto:support@bramleyhousehome.com">support@bramleyhousehome.com</a> with the scope and timing, and we'll put a proposal together.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I combine trade pricing with other offers?</summary><p>Trade pricing can't be combined with other discount codes or promotions. It replaces them on every order.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can I order for a client's address?</summary><p>Yes. Enter your client's address at checkout and the order ships straight to them anywhere in the contiguous United States. We ship free wherever we can. Some custom and larger pieces travel by freight, and any delivery charge is shown at checkout before you pay.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can the program change?</summary><p>From time to time we may update trade pricing, benefits or terms. We'll email members before any change takes effect. Orders already placed keep the terms they were placed under.</p></details>
<details><summary>What about returns and damage?</summary><p>Trade orders follow the same Shipping &amp; Returns policy as every Bramley House order.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can my colleagues use my code?</summary><p>Each code is tied to the approved member's account. Colleagues at your firm are welcome to apply under the same business.</p></details>
<details><summary>Who can apply?</summary><p>Architects, interior designers, decorators, home stagers, and inns, guest houses and rentals, buying on behalf of clients or a business.</p></details>
<details><summary>What if I'm not sure I qualify, or I don't see what I do here?</summary><p>Email us at <a href="mailto:support@bramleyhousehome.com">support@bramleyhousehome.com</a> and tell us a little about your work. If you furnish rooms for clients, guests or a business, we'd like to hear from you, and we'll let you know how we can work together.</p></details>

      </div>
